<title>USA: MagneTek acquires interest in software co.</title>
<headline>MagneTek acquires interest in software co.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>MagneTek Inc said Monday it had acquired a 32 percent equity position in Automation Systems and Products Inc, a closely held developer of factory automation software.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>MagneTek said it also has entered into agreements with Automation Systems for selected PC-based software technology and licensing agreements.</p>
</text>
